                <mxCell id="298" value="&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 30px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;Analysis 1: 80/20 Pareto Distribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#33FF99,#FFFF00);fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#001DBC;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4549" y="1" width="623" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="299" value="&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 30px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;Analysis 2: Diffusion of Innovation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#33FF99,#FFFF00);fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#001DBC;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4573" y="553" width="623" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="300" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Innovators, Early Adopters, Early Majority: Characteristics&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Products show an upward trajectory in revenueProducts may or may not be at the top in terms of category generating the most revenue at present&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In the case of early majority, they are top performing categories likely captured in the Pareto 80/20 analysis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Decision Point to Achieve Business Case&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;To recommend products of such categories to customers to further drive revenue&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;By popularizing new and trending items, capture consumer usage of the platform by making it the go-to platform for e-commerce purchases&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#33FF99;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4200" y="1098" width="679" height="224" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="301" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Late Majority, Laggards&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;: Characteristics&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Products start to show an downward trejactory in terms of revenue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decreasing trend in order count which indicate lower quantity of products within these categories&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In the case of early majority, they are top performing categories likely captured in the Pareto 80/20 analysis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;Decision Point to Achieve Business Case&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;To sell products at a discounted rate to clear out laggards and late majority products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;By offering discounted prices and minimising profit margins for sellers on the platform, sellers will eventually phase these items out of the platform, ensuring that the platform is futureproof and keeps up with changing consumer patterns&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Offers a &quot;bargain basement&quot; for shoppers to look for hidden gems whilst clearing existing inventory&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=light-dark(#33FF99,#FFFF00);" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4931" y="1098" width="679" height="214" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="302" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Use the category_performance_monthly datamart to sort product based on revenue from 2017 to 2018. By analysing trend of monthly revenue across the different categories, fit the items into the 5 adopter categories before making a decision on what to do with the products&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=light-dark(#33FF99,#FFFF00);" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4545" y="720" width="679" height="214" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="303" value="" style="shape=singleArrow;direction=south;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rotation=60;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4730" y="876" width="60" height="282" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="304" value="" style="shape=singleArrow;direction=south;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rotation=-59;labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);labelBorderColor=default;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4984.999581933605" y="878.0007621135331" width="60" height="282" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="305" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Use the category_performance_monthly datamart to identify the top 20 category product types.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;These products contribute to &amp;gt;80% of the total sales within the dataset&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Focus on recommending these products which are likely for customers to purchase&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Improve overall consumer retention within the platform&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=light-dark(#33FF99,#FFFF00);" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4526" y="157" width="679" height="295" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
