                <mxCell id="320" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Validation errors can be generated in the form of HTML docs and notified via email&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Provides localized telemetry: observed vs. expected values, missing counts, success percentages, and element lists. (Main test we are running)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=default;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" parent="319" vertex="1">
