                <mxCell id="321" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Validation errors are in the form of json artifacts and raw text files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Provides the exact compiled SQL query and raw database error stack trace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=default;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" parent="319" vertex="1">
